return {h=12,w=300,cr=75,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"indeterminate"},st={105,105,75,65,100,50},ab={{1,0},{60,0},{143,1}},genus={en="Sludge Pokémon",es="Pokémon Lodo",pt="Pokémon Lodo"},flavor={en={[1]="Thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.",[2]="Thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.",[3]="Smells so awful, it can cause fainting. Through degeneration, it lost its sense of smell.",[4]="They love to gather in smelly areas where sludge ac cumulates, making the stench around them worse.",[5]="Its body is made of a powerful poison. Touching it accidentally will cause a fever that requires bed rest.",[6]="As it moves, a very strong poison leaks from it, making the ground there barren for three years.",[7]="From MUK’s body seeps a foul fluid that gives off a nose-bendingly horrible stench. Just one drop of this Pokémon’s body fluid can turn a pool stagnant and rancid.",[8]="This Pokémon’s favorite food is anything that is repugnantly filthy. In dirty towns where people think nothing of throwing away litter on the streets, MUK are certain to gather.",[9]="It prefers warm and humid habitats. In the summertime, the toxic substances in its body intensify, making MUK reek like putrid kitchen garbage.",[10]="It is usually undetectable because it blends in with the ground. Touching it can cause terrible poisoning.",[11]="Thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.",[12]="A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.",[13]="A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.",[14]="A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.",[15]="They love to gather in smelly areas where sludge accumulates, making the stench around them worse.",[16]="Its body is made of a powerful poison. Touching it accidentally will cause a fever that requires bed rest.",[17]="A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.",[18]="A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.",[21]="It’s so stinky! Muk’s body contains toxic elements, and any plant will wilt when it passes by.",[22]="It’s so stinky! Muk’s body contains toxic elements, and any plant will wilt when it passes by.",[23]="They love to gather in smelly areas where sludge accumulates, making the stench around them worse.",[24]="A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.",[25]="From Muk’s body seeps a foul fluid that gives off a nose-bendingly horrible stench. Just one drop of this Pokémon’s body fluid can turn a pool stagnant and rancid.",[26]="This Pokémon’s favorite food is anything that is repugnantly filthy. In dirty towns where people think nothing of throwing away litter on the streets, Muk are certain to gather.",[27]="The stench it gives off will make your nose scrunch up. Still, there are Muk fans who think that’s a good thing.",[28]="After recent environmental improvements, this Pokémon is now hardly seen at all. People speculate that it may go extinct at some point.",[29]="Their food sources have decreased, and their numbers have declined sharply. Sludge ponds are being built to prevent their extinction.",[30]="Because they scatter germs everywhere, they’ve long been targeted for extermination, leading to a steep decline in their population.",[31]="Smells so awful, it can cause fainting. Through degeneration of its nose, it lost its sense of smell.",[32]="Smells so awful, it can cause fainting. Through degeneration of its nose, it lost its sense of smell."},es={[23]="Les encanta reunirse en zonas apestosas donde se acumula el lodo, haciendo su olor más insoportable.",[24]="Su cuerpo segrega un fluido tóxico que elimina la vida vegetal cuando la toca.",[25]="Muk emana por todo el cuerpo un fluido maloliente que obliga a taparse la nariz. Con solo una gota de la sustancia que exuda este Pokémon, se podría contaminar un estanque.",[26]="A este Pokémon le encanta comer cosas repulsivas. En ciudades sucias en las que la gente tira la basura por la calle, los Muk tienen, sin duda, su punto de encuentro.",[27]="Desprende un hedor insoportable que invita a taparse la nariz. A algunos fanáticos de este Pokémon, este hecho les parece encantador.",[28]="Con la reciente preocupación por el medio ambiente, este Pokémon escasea cada vez más. Podría considerarse en peligro de extinción.",[29]="Su número ha disminuido por falta de sustento, por lo que se han creado estanques de lodo artificiales para salvarlo de la extinción.",[30]="Al ser un portador de toda clase de gérmenes, ha sido perseguido a lo largo de la historia hasta verse abocado casi a la extinción.",[31]="Huele tan mal que puede provocar desmayos. Su nariz se ha atrofiado de tal manera que ha perdido por completo el sentido del olfato.",[32]="Huele tan mal que puede provocar desmayos. Su nariz se ha atrofiado de tal manera que ha perdido por completo el sentido del olfato."},pt="Tem um cheiro tão horrível que pode causar desmaios. Com a degeneração do nariz, perdeu o olfato."},evo={{s=88},{s=89,from=88,c={{t="level-up",lv=38}}}},moves={[1]={1,1,1,50,1,139,30,139,33,107,37,124,45,106,53,103,60,151},[2]={1,1,1,50,1,139,30,139,33,107,37,124,45,106,53,103,60,151},[3]={1,139,1,1,1,106,23,107,31,103,33,106,37,50,45,124,45,151,60,188},[4]={1,139,1,1,1,106,23,107,31,103,33,106,37,50,45,124,45,151,60,188},[5]={1,139,1,1,1,106,4,106,8,50,13,124,19,107,26,103,34,151,47,188,61,262},[6]={1,139,1,1,1,106,4,106,8,50,13,124,19,107,26,103,34,151,47,188,61,262},[7]={1,139,1,1,1,106,4,106,8,50,13,124,19,107,26,103,34,151,47,188,61,262},[8]={1,139,1,1,1,106,1,189,4,106,7,189,12,50,17,107,20,124,23,426,28,374,33,103,36,188,44,151,54,441,65,262},[9]={1,139,1,1,1,106,1,189,4,106,7,189,12,50,17,107,20,124,23,426,28,37